# Pairs with SagaFallbackOnlyAcrossFull. The increment advances its frontier
# past an undecided saga it left out, so the next increment meets only the
# saga's terminals and must fall back to a full backup for a saga that never
# straddled the full capture.
MODULE: SagaFallbackOnlyAcrossFullNoHoldBack
TARGET: SagaFallbackOnlyAcrossFull
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the frontier is not held back for a left-out saga

--- FIND
NewHeads == [p \in Parts |-> IF Held /\ Window(p) # {} THEN Min(Window(p)) - 1 ELSE Len(wal[p])]
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the frontier always advances to the drained head.
NewHeads == [p \in Parts |-> Len(wal[p])]
--- END
